  m_text: 'This is sample reader text. It is used only to check wrapping, clipping and scrolling.


    The reader keeps a fixed font size. Narrowing the window should produce more lines and increase the content height.


    Replace this sample with a longer passage during the layout check. The first line should remain below the title, with padding at the top and sides.


    Use the mouse wheel or drag inside the reader to move through a long document. Content should stay within the viewport.


    This final paragraph makes it easy to confirm that the bottom of the document can be reached.'
